      "cooked": "<p>Try this:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Legacy and Tempest vs. Baron Blade in Insula Primalis</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Since the digital game requires three heroes, take anyone as the third (preferably with the least HP, so Argent Adept). On the third hero's turn, all they do is skip.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Can you beat Blade with just Legacy and Tempest?</p>",
