      "created_at": "2016-03-30T20:10:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I beat it pretty cleanly. Same setup as pwatson - Danger Sense vs.Volcano makes it simple. Can accomplish roughly the same effect with Tempest's incap if needed too.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>[Edit: Just tried it again without allowing myself Danger Sense. Managed to win without even incapping Mr. Drake. All four armor cards (Superhuman Fortitude of the Resilient Shielding Winds ftw) got played pretty early on, made things much easier. Legacy shrugging off dino bites like a boss. Reclaimed a Take Down twice as well.]</p>",
